  "description": "After failing the auditions for a role he'd been preparing for, Lyle takes a trip to Korea for a change of pace. As a black-footed cat-man, he was not able to present himself as a top amongst the larger beastmen, but having travelled to this place with all sorts of small and cute animals that suited his tastes, he thinks he could be a top here. After downloading an online dating app, Lyle starts chatting with a rabbit-man with the handle \"Kkyu,\" and steadily grows fond of him. Finally, the day they meet arrives! However, what appears before Lyle, as his heart pounds, is...a brute-like rabbit...?! \n\n*\"Is this person...really my Kkyu...?!\"* \n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 4 side stories.*",
